# Subagent-driven-development scratch workspace (ledgers, briefs, review packages)
.superpowers

# Harness-managed worktrees/scratch state (includes full node_modules copies
# for isolated worktrees — never intended for source control)
.claude

# Working engineering notes for AI coding agents. Deliberately untracked: this
# is a candid internal log (shipped-defect post-mortems, measured flake rates,
# "this assertion pinned the bug as expected behaviour"), written for
# maintainers and agents rather than for readers of a public repo. The
# contributor-facing distillation is ARCHITECTURE.md, which IS tracked.
#
# This file lives on disk but is not tracked here, and has been removed from
# this repository's history entirely (git-filter-repo, 2026-08-15). Its full
# 74-commit history is preserved in the private companion repository
# kenduck1/PageDown-internal.
CLAUDE.md

# Internal working documents, untracked for the same reason as CLAUDE.md.
#
#   docs/superpowers/  -- per-sub-project design specs and implementation
#                         plans, written as a working record (rejected
#                         approaches, measured dead ends, disclosed gaps).
#   docs/design-handoff/ -- the original UI design brief and its clickable
#                         HTML prototype.
#
# Ignored by subtree rather than as a blanket `docs/` so the directory stays
# available for genuinely public documentation later. ARCHITECTURE.md is the
# tracked, contributor-facing distillation of the material here.
#
# As with CLAUDE.md above, these are gone from this repository's history
# entirely and preserved in kenduck1/PageDown-internal.
docs/superpowers/
docs/design-handoff/

# Vitest
coverage

# Playwright — HTML/blob reporters and raw run artifacts (traces, videos,
# screenshots) are regenerated per run and not durable evidence. The JSON
# reporter output is likewise transient; per-gate findings are recorded
# manually in docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-25-phase0-findings.md and in
# the specific result files each gate task commits explicitly (e.g.
# tests/gates/results/gate2-timing.json), not in this auto-generated report.
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
playwright/.cache
tests/gates/results/playwright-report.json

# TypeScript incremental build info (regenerated by `pnpm typecheck`)
*.tsbuildinfo
